CampaignCue
A SaaS platform for Instagram comment-to-DM automation.

Maintained by Shubham Sharma and Yashwant Khatri.

This repository is a fork of instagram-comment-to-dm by Anish Raj:
https://github.com/im-anishraj/instagram-comment-to-dm

The whole repository is distributed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Upstream contributions
----------------------
Copyright (c) 2026 Anish Raj

The initial import of this repository (commit df7e7a7) is the upstream
instagram-comment-to-dm codebase, including the CampaignCue name, landing
pages, documentation, Prisma schema and migrations, and the original web app
and worker. Those portions remain the work of Anish Raj and are used under the
MIT License. Upstream files that were later modified are still upstream work,
with the fork's changes layered on top.

CampaignCue fork contributions
------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2026 Shubham Sharma and Yashwant Khatri

Changes made after the initial import, as recorded in this repository's git
history. They include automation matching, policy and resolver logic; the
delivery state, claim and renderer modules; CRM contacts; CSV exports; data
retention; tracked-link APIs; the contacts dashboard; and the related tests,
migrations and hardening work. Run `git log` for the authoritative record.

Third-party software
--------------------
Dependencies are installed from npm and remain under their own licenses, as
declared in each package. No third-party source is vendored in this repository.
